{"version":2,"surah":108,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"108:1","arabic":" إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","page":602,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muḥammad], al-Kawthar.","id":"Sungguh, Kami telah memberimu (Muhammad) nikmat yang banyak.","latinEn":"Inna aAAtaynakaalkawthar","latinId":"Innā a‘ṭainākal-kauṡar(a).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّآ","en":"Indeed, We","id":"Indeed, We","t":"innā"},{"a":"أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ","en":"We have given you","id":"We have given you","t":"aʿṭaynāka"},{"a":"ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","en":"Al-Kauthar","id":"Al-Kauthar","t":"l-kawthara"}]},{"n":2,"key":"108:2","arabic":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","page":602,"juz":30,"en":"So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].","id":"Maka laksanakanlah salat karena Tuhanmu, dan berkurbanlah (sebagai ibadah dan mendekatkan diri kepada Allah).","latinEn":"Fasalli lirabbika wanhar","latinId":"Faṣalli lirabbika wanḥar.","words":[{"a":"فَصَلِّ","en":"So pray","id":"So pray","t":"faṣalli"},{"a":"لِرَبِّكَ","en":"to your Lord","id":"to your Lord","t":"lirabbika"},{"a":"وَٱنْحَرْ","en":"and sacrifice","id":"and sacrifice","t":"wa-in'ḥar"}]},{"n":3,"key":"108:3","arabic":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","page":602,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","id":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang membencimu dialah yang terputus (dari rahmat Allah).","latinEn":"Inna shani-aka huwa al-abtar","latinId":"Inna syāni'aka huwal-abtar(u).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"شَانِئَكَ","en":"your enemy","id":"your enemy","t":"shāni-aka"},{"a":"هُوَ","en":"he (is)","id":"he (is)","t":"huwa"},{"a":"ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","en":"the one cut off","id":"the one cut off","t":"l-abtaru"}]}]}